  "chain": "ineffective single point vulnerability PM strategy for exciter [cause D] -> exciter brushes degraded (worn/carbon binding) -> remaining brushes overheat from current redistribution -> electrical arcing/flashover at collector ring -> loss of generator field/voltage collapse -> turbine trip -> automatic reactor trip [AFW actuated via AMSAC as designed]",
  "golden_questions": [
    "Q1",
